-- triangles and arrows are drawn
each direction looks different: 1
none of them is a question mark or empty: 1
the other codes of a direction draw the same shape: right 1 1 1, down 1 1
left 1 1, up 1 1
a filled square is drawn: 1
-- plain ASCII stand-ins
ellipsis is a dot: 1, quotes: 1 1, dashes: 1 1 1
check marks are a star: 1 1, crosses an x: 1 1, circles an o: 1
angle quotes: 1 1
-- anything else the font does not have is a question mark
Greek capital delta: 1
a stand-in is not the question mark: 1
